    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      229.37,
      401.01,
      253.55
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE ANTI-DUMPING AND COUNTERVAILING DUTIESACT, NO. 2 OF 2018",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      268.01,
      401.9,
      292.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      306.77,
      401.89,
      330.95
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Anti-Dumping andCountervailing Duties (Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      345.41,
      401.88,
      421.31
    ],
    "text": "2. (1) The Anti-Dumping and Countervailing Duties Act,No. 2 of 2018 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended by the substitution for thewords \u201cDirector-General\u201d and \u201cDepartment\u201d wherever thosewords occur in the principal enactment, of the words\u201cSecretary\u201d and \u201cOIT\u201d respectively.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      435.77,
      401.9,
      537.35
    ],
    "text": "(2) There shall be substituted for the words \u201cDirector-General of Commerce\u201d and \u201cDepartment of Commerce\u201dwherever those words occur in any notice, notification,contract, communication or other document issued or madeunder the principal enactment, of the words \u201cSecretary tothe Ministry of the Minister assigned the subject ofInternational Trade\u201d and \u201cOffice for International Trade\u201drespectively.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      551.81,
      401.86,
      576.11
    ],
    "text": "3. Section 85 of the principal enactment is herebyamended as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      590.57,
      401.87,
      614.75
    ],
    "text": "(1)by the repeal of the definition of the expression\u201cDepartment\u201d and \u201cDirector-General\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      630.77,
      401.87,
      669.71
    ],
    "text": "(2)by the repeal of the definition of the expression\u201cMinister\u201d and the substitution therefor of thefollowing :-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
